msgstr "Without pressing [Stop Broadcast / 송출 중지], you should have waited with your back to the concourse (north) until the broadcast ended. (Rule p.4)"

msgid "[정지]를 눌러도 벨트가 멈추지 않았습니다."
msgstr "The belt did not stop when [Stop / 정지] was pressed."

